    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d973">

                <pb facs="1112" n="1016" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1016"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Woodford to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February 19,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 150.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    this day of telegram from the Department as follows:<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d973-f1"/></p>
                <p>Accordingly, I have to-day addressed an official communication to the Spanish
                    minister of foreign affairs, stating that I am in receipt of telegraphic
                    dispatch from the State Department directing me to inform his excellency that
                    his note closes the incident raised by the publication of the private letter
                    from the late minister of Spain at Washington and assuring his excellency of the
                    gratification felt by my Government at his frank statements, which my Government
                    had from the outset confidently expected.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stewart L. Woodford.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d973-a1.xml" xpointer="d973-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
